{"id": "34066", "title": "总裁花心哲学(抢婚一族2)", "author": "安琪", "category": "文学名著", "count": 41, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34066.htm", "intro": "运输业中呼风唤雨的穆沇，好死不死抽中签王，被派去应付专找有钱人吃饭的邵家鸿门宴。他倒想看，和叔叔到处推销自己的这女人能有多美？然而这和他意中人气质相仿的女子，竟是传闻的捞金女？！他决定顺着他们完美的剧本，假装成迷恋她的金主，好好饱嚐过她的甜美后——要他娶她？等下辈子吧！美貌、才识、温柔——却让邵翊荷成为上等牺牲品！为了回报被抚养长大的人情，她放弃追求真爱的权利，用一场场相亲，让利益来决定她的结婚对象。但第一眼见到他，她就芳心暗属，甚至奉献自己的一切，即使他对她，根本不会有真心……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34066", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2167319.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2167320.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2167321.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2167322.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2167323.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2167324.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2167325.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2167326.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2167327.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2167328.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2167329.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2167330.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2167331.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2167332.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2167333.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2167334.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2167335.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2167336.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2167337.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2167338.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2167339.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2167340.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2167341.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2167342.html", "available": false}, {"title": 